{"availability":"available","full":"sepoina/viteTranslate","name":"viteTranslate","description":"i18n for React + Vite with no translation keys: write text in your own language right in JSX. The plugin extracts it, syncs YAML tables, compiles ICU plurals and dates at build time, and lazy-loads each language. Optional LLM translation. 5 kB gzip runtime, zero dependencies.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2023-12-19T20:40:09Z","updated":"2026-10-10T20:45:21Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://sepoina.github.io/viteTranslate/","topics":["auto-translation","i18n","icu","icu-messageformat","internationalization","jsx","l10n","languages","lazy-loading","llm","locale","localization","react","react-hooks","rolldown","translation","translation-management","vite","vite-plugin","zero-dependencies"],"demo":"https://sepoina.github.io/viteTranslate/playground/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.336Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.336Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.336Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T02:35:48.234Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.336Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A simpler translation workflow for React and Vite.","Write text naturally in JSX. viteTranslate extracts strings, keeps locale files in sync, and compiles translations as part of your Vite workflow. No hand-written keys. No separate extraction workflow. No extra runtime dependencies.","✅ native support · 🟡 partial support, official add-on or extra setup · ❌ not offered by the project. Documentation checked on October 10, 2026: Lingui 6, FormatJS (react-intl 12), i18next 26 + react-i18next 17."],"features":["How to read it: a ❌ means the project's own tooling doesn't offer it — a third-party tool may still fill the gap. Native support does not mean zero configuration: lazy loading still needs application code in the other…","¹ Extraction inside the Vite lifecycle: the plugin extracts the markers and syncs one YAML table per language by itself — a quick check when vite dev starts, a full scan before every build. Missing keys added, stale…","Zero runtime dependencies: none declared, and not on trust: the test suite asserts that the browser runtime imports nothing beyond React and the virtual module. @babel/core and Vite are peer dependencies: they run the…","Official VS Code extension: viteTranslate's lists every marked string with its translation status, opens the language file right on the key, runs Sync and the LLM in one click, and highlights marked strings as you type.…","³ No message parsing at runtime: tables are compiled at build time into ready-made values. In a production build parses nothing, neither ICU nor HTML — which is also why it renders server-side. Lingui precompiles ICU,…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sepoina/viteTranslate/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"19c8652162c634d79e3907b241dbbf4918cc4748a4816f70d958cef3d07fdf4a","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.433Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.433Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A simpler translation workflow for React and Vite.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sepoina/viteTranslate/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"19c8652162c634d79e3907b241dbbf4918cc4748a4816f70d958cef3d07fdf4a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sepoina/viteTranslate/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.434Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T20:45:21Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sepoina/viteTranslate/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.435Z","hash":"19c8652162c634d79e3907b241dbbf4918cc4748a4816f70d958cef3d07fdf4a","originalBytes":18809,"storedBytes":18809,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["doc","vitetranslate","react","vite","runtime","sync","every","ll